        173.45,
        530.14,
        202.92,
        116.62,
        202.92
      ],
      "text": "The undersigned is directed to say that with effect from the\n19th September, 1995 -"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 7,
      "poly": [
        150.53,
        213.87,
        530.74,
        213.87,
        530.74,
        288.81,
        150.53,
        288.81
      ],
      "text": "(i) Shri Eduardo Faleiro, Minister of State in the Ministry\n of Chemicals and Fertilisers, Minister of State in the\n Ministry of Parliamentary Affairs and Minister of State\n in the Departments of Electronics and Ocean\n Development, relinquished the additional charge of the\n office of the Minister of State in the Ministry of\n Parliamentary Affairs."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 8,
      "poly": [
        144.59,
        294.7,
        532.52,
        294.7,
        532.52,
        357.85,
        144.59,
        357.85
      ],
      "text": "(ii) Smt. Krishna Sahi relinquished the office of the\n Minister of State in the Ministry of Civil Supplies,\n Consumer Affairs and Public Distribution and assumed\n the office of the Minister of State in the Ministry of\n Civil Supplies, Consumer Affairs and Public\n Distribution (Department of Civil Supplies)."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 9,
      "poly": [
        141.61,
        364.59,
        536.69,
        364.59,
        536.69,
        478.26,
        141.61,
        478.26
      ],
      "text": "(iii) Shri Mallikarjun, Minister of State in the Ministry of\n Defence, Minister of State in the Ministry of\n Parliamentary Affairs and Minister of State in the\n Ministry of Railways, relinquished the office of the\n Minister of State in the Ministry of Defence and the\n additional charge of the office of the Minister of\n State in the Ministry of Railways and assumed the\n office of the Minister of State in the Ministry of\n Defence (Department of Defence). He will continue to\n hold the charge of the office of the Minister of State\n in the Ministry of Parliamentary Affairs."
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 10,
      "poly": [
        151.13,
        481.62,
        537.88,
        481.62,
        537.88,
        538.04,
        151.13,
        538.04
      ],
      "text": "(iv) Shri S.S. Ahluwalia, Minister of State in the Ministry\n of Urban Affairs and Employment (Department of Urban\n Affairs and Poverty Alleviation), assumed the charge\n of the office, also, of the Minister of State in the\n Ministry of Parliamentary Affairs."
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 11,
      "poly": [
        160.06,
        542.25,
        542.05,
        542.25,
        542.05,
        616.34,
        160.06,
        616.34
      ],
      "text": "(v) Shri Venod Sharma relinquished the office of the\n Minister of State in the Ministry of Civil Supplies,\n Consumer Affairs and Public Distribution and assumed\n the office of the Minister of State in the Ministry of\n Civil Supplies, Consumer Affairs and Public\n Distribution (Department of Consumer Affairs and Public\n Distribution System)."
    },
